# nocheck: persona-block-rationale — Friendica authenticates twice: oauth2-proxy gates the vhost, then the user must still fill Friendica's own /login form because stock Friendica has no header-trusted auto-login (Owa.php / OAuth/Token.php read HTTP_AUTHORIZATION for API endpoints only, never for the web session) and the ldapauth addon merely bootstraps the friendica.user row. The shared helpers stop after the Keycloak round-trip, so the second form is never filled (see TODO.md "Migrate auth to the saml addon").
PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true

# nocheck: persona-block-rationale — see PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED above.
